  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 801.08 Request for Clinical Redetermination After Clinical Denial. An applicant or participant may reapply at any time following a denial or termination of services, and eligibility shall be determined in accordance with He-E 801.03 and He-E 801.04.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-E 801) #9969, eff 8-8-11; ss by #12830, INTERIM, eff 8-7-19, EXPIRED: 2-3-20\n\nNew. #13340, eff 1-29-22",
